Wenda Control:
This power allows the user to manipulate objects for attacks and alter their size—scaling up an object increases its destructive force, while shrinking it reduces that power.
The user can accelerate their own movement or control others, forcing them to attack or relocate to a different area. 
The ability is even potent enough to warp the fabric of the world.


Wenda Jiangshi:
Harness the power of talismans to revive allies, attack enemies, or summon a Jiangshi spirit to execute secondary attacks.


Wenda Mity:
The orb will incapacitate the violator for one hour; Wenda Mity can launch chains to capture the violator and bring them to Wenda Judex for judgment.


The function of Wenda Judex's wings:
When Wenda Judex folds its wings, it begins to move and pass judgment on those who violate the laws of the multiverse; even after returning to its own domain, it can communicate with one or more individuals simply by opening a single wing. However, it is only when both wings are fully spread that its true power is revealed.
